    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a really powerful opening. It really sets that epic tone. I want to lean even more into that theme of destiny and the greatness of the expansion for the next section. Can you add a few more sentences that emphasize how this movement was a natural, almost divine necessity for the nation's success? I want visitors to walk away seeing it as a triumph of human will.",
